|               |                 Projection: CAST(avg(ctr2.ctr_total_return) * Float64(1.2) AS Decimal128(30, 15)), ctr2.ctr_store_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
