|               |             ProjectionExec: expr=[CAST(avg(ctr2.ctr_total_return)@1 * 1.2 AS Decimal128(30, 15)) as avg(ctr2.ctr_total_return) * Float64(1.2), ctr_store_sk@0 as ctr_store_sk]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
